{
  "name": "Storm Aura",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You emanate a stormy, magical aura while you rage. The aura extends 10 feet from you in every direction, but not through total cover.</p><p>Your aura has an effect that is active for the duration of your rage, and an additional empowered effect.</p><p>You can empower your aura only once per rage.</p><p>Choose blaze, thunderstorm, or blizzard. Your aura's effect depends on your choice, as detailed below. You can change this choice whenever you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p><p>If your aura's effects require a Saving Throw, the DC equals 8 + your Proficiency bonus + your Constitution modifier.</p>",
